      "title": "Use of Proceeds",
      "excerpt": "USE OF PROCEEDS Unless we state otherwise in any prospectus supplement, we will use the net proceeds we receive from the sale of the offered securities: \u2022 blacklining:none; to finance our ongoing construction and maintenance programs; \u200b \u2022 blacklining:none; to redeem, repurchase, repay or retire outstanding indebtedness and preferred stock; and \u200b \u2022 blacklining:none; for other general corporate purposes. \u200b The prospectus supplement relating to a particular offering of securities by us will identify the use of proceeds for that offering. We will not receive any of the proceeds from the sale of any securities by any selling securityholders. 4 TABLE OF CONTENTS \u200b DESCRIPTION OF SENIOR SECURED DEBT SECURITIES General The senior secured debt securities will be issued in one or more series under, and secured by, our senior secured indenture dated as of August\u00a015, 2002, as amended and supplemente",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
    },
    {
